{"seq":1,"slug":"parallel-tool-calls","title":"并行工具调用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-tool-use-function-calling/orchestration/parallel-tool-calls","wordCount":1167,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"并行工具调用\">并行工具调用</h1><p>用户问「上海和东京现在分别几点、各自天气如何」，最笨的做法是查上海时间、等结果、查东京时间、等结果、查上海天气……四次串行往返，延迟相加。但这四件事彼此毫无依赖，完全可以在一轮里同时发出、并发执行。这就是并行工具调用要榨取的延迟红利，也是工具编排里最容易拿到的一笔收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-何时能并行-何时不能\">核心概念：何时能并行，何时不能</h2><p>并行的唯一前提是<strong>调用之间没有数据依赖</strong>——后一个的参数不依赖前一个的结果。下表区分两种典型形态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>能否并行</th>\n<th>归属</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扇出（无依赖）</td>\n<td>同时查三城天气</td>\n<td>能，本篇主题</td>\n<td>并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流水线（有依赖）</td>\n<td>先搜 ID 再用 ID 查详情</td>\n<td>不能，必须串行</td>\n<td><a href=\"multi-step-tooluse\">多步工具链</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>先搜 ID（串），再并发查多个 ID 详情（并）</td>\n<td>分段：段内并、段间串</td>\n<td>两者结合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>模型会自己判断该不该并行：当它在<a href=\"../foundations/function-calling-loop\">函数调用循环</a>的某一帧里发现几件事互不依赖，就会在同一个 assistant 帧里输出<strong>多个</strong> <code>tool_calls</code>（Anthropic 是多个 <code>tool_use</code> 块），每个带各自的 <code>call_id</code>。这正是当初强调 <code>call_id</code> 重要性的兑现场景——三个结果并发返回时，全靠 ID 各自归位。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[模型: 一帧内输出 3 个 tool_calls&lt;br/&gt;各带独立 call_id] --&gt; B[宿主: 并发派发]&#10;  B --&gt; C1[查上海天气]&#10;  B --&gt; C2[查东京天气]&#10;  B --&gt; C3[查纽约天气]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[按 call_id 收集全部结果]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D&#10;  C3 --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[同一轮回灌全部 tool_result]&#10;  E --&gt; F[模型据三者综合作答]\">flowchart TD\n  A[模型: 一帧内输出 3 个 tool_calls&lt;br/&gt;各带独立 call_id] --&gt; B[宿主: 并发派发]\n  B --&gt; C1[查上海天气]\n  B --&gt; C2[查东京天气]\n  B --&gt; C3[查纽约天气]\n  C1 --&gt; D[按 call_id 收集全部结果]\n  C2 --&gt; D\n  C3 --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[同一轮回灌全部 tool_result]\n  E --&gt; F[模型据三者综合作答]</pre><h2 id=\"延迟模型-从相加到取最大\">延迟模型：从相加到取最大</h2><p>并行的价值可以量化。设单次工具调用耗时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，串行总延迟是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{n} t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，并行总延迟则是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_i t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（加上一点固定调度开销）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个调用耗时相近、都约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 时，串行是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\cdot t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，并行是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，理论加速比接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。</p>\n<p>实践中加速比拿不满，受限于三点：模型不一定识别出可并行（描述含糊时它会保守串行）、宿主的并发度上限、以及共享下游（三个调用打同一个限流的 API）。但即便只是把三个独立的网络往返从相加压成取最大，对交互式应用的体感提升也极明显。</p>\n<h2 id=\"宿主侧-并发执行与结果归集\">宿主侧：并发执行与结果归集</h2><p>模型只负责「在一帧里提议多个调用」，真正的并发执行是宿主的活。两条工程要点：</p>\n<p>其一，<strong>用语言原生的并发原语并发派发</strong>——Python 的 <code>asyncio.gather</code>、JS 的 <code>Promise.all</code>、Go 的 goroutine——别傻乎乎地 for 循环逐个 await，那等于把模型的并行意图又拍回串行。</p>\n<p>其二，<strong>全部结果到齐后在同一轮一次性回灌</strong>。协议要求：assistant 帧里有几个 <code>tool_calls</code>，紧接着就必须有对应数量、ID 一一匹配的 <code>tool</code> 结果帧，缺一个模型就会报错。所以即使某个调用失败，也要回灌它的错误结果（按<a href=\"../mechanics/tool-errors\">工具错误处理</a>的写法），而不能直接丢弃——丢弃会破坏 ID 配对，导致整轮失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么时候要主动关掉并行\">什么时候要主动关掉并行</h2><p>并行不总是好事，有三种情况要主动关闭（OpenAI 设 <code>parallel_tool_calls:false</code>，Anthropic 设 <code>disable_parallel_tool_use:true</code>，此时模型每轮至多一个工具）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有副作用且需顺序保证</strong>：先扣库存再创建订单，并发执行可能产生竞态，必须串行。</li>\n<li><strong>下游强限流</strong>：并发只会更快撞限流，串行反而更稳。</li>\n<li><strong>要强约束模型只走单工具</strong>：某些评测或审计场景需要每步可追溯，单工具更清晰。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>需要提醒一个 2025–2026 年的兼容性细节：据 OpenAI 文档，非微调模型的 strict 模式已与并行调用兼容，但微调模型在一轮调多个函数时 strict 可能被降级——若你既用微调模型又强依赖 schema 可靠性，宁可关掉并行换取 strict。这条取舍把本篇与<a href=\"../mechanics/tool-schemas\">工具模式定义</a>的 strict 讨论接上了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>并行的唯一前提是调用间无数据依赖；有依赖的必须串行，属于多步工具链。</li>\n<li>模型在一帧内输出多个带独立 <code>call_id</code> 的调用，结果靠 ID 各自归位。</li>\n<li>延迟从串行的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到并行的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，理论加速比接近调用数，实际受模型识别、并发上限、共享下游限制。</li>\n<li>宿主用原生并发原语派发，全部结果（含失败结果）必须在同一轮一一对应回灌，丢弃任一结果会破坏 ID 配对致整轮失败。</li>\n<li>有副作用需顺序、下游强限流、需单工具可追溯时主动关闭并行；微调模型并行与 strict 可能冲突，需取舍。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"multi-step-tooluse\">多步工具链</a> —— 有依赖时如何串行推进。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并行工具调用","id":"并行工具调用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：何时能并行，何时不能","id":"核心概念-何时能并行-何时不能"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟模型：从相加到取最大","id":"延迟模型-从相加到取最大"},{"level":2,"text":"宿主侧：并发执行与结果归集","id":"宿主侧-并发执行与结果归集"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候要主动关掉并行","id":"什么时候要主动关掉并行"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"工具错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-tool-use-function-calling/mechanics/tool-errors"},"next":{"title":"多步工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-tool-use-function-calling/orchestration/multi-step-tooluse"}}